  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, $r, s, t$ are prime numbers.\n$\\therefore$ Selection of $p$ and $q$ are as under\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/PK48_ScZ9Uo3f0yPK15Dvens-4AMMDMQM64oOlmGudc.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\therefore$ Total number of ways to select $s=9$.\nSimilarly, the number of ways to select $t=5$.\n$\\therefore$ Total number of ways $=5 \\times 9 \\times 5=225$.",
    "image": null
